{"lessonId":"L2M3L1","title":"Campania 坎帕尼亞","content":"<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2980b9 0%,#3498db 100%)'><h1>🌋 Campania</h1><p class='subtitle'>古老品種與火山土壤的交響曲</p></section><section class='slide campania-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='campania-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='campania-map' class='campania-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#2980b9;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌋 Campania 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(41,128,185,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2980b9'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>古老品種與火山土壤，2500年葡萄酒歷史的搖籃</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Taurasi DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>南義最頂級紅酒，Aglianico單寧之王</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#9b59b6;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #9b59b6;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(155,89,182,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #8e44ad'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#8e44ad;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>Fiano di Avellino DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>濃郁白酒，火山煙燻礦物感</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(155,89,182,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #9b59b6'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#9b59b6;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#9b59b6'>Greco di Tufo DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>高酸度白酒，凝灰岩礦物感</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #e67e22;padding-bottom:8px'>✨ B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(230,126,34,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e67e22'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e67e22'>Aglianico del Taburno DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Taburno山區Aglianico</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(231,76,60,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e74c3c'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>Vesuvio DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>維蘇威火山「基督之淚」</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(46,204,113,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #2ecc71'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#2ecc71;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#2ecc71'>Campi Flegrei DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>超級火山「燃燒的田野」</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide campania-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='campania-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='campania-map' class='campania-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#2980b9;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌋 Campania 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(41,128,185,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2980b9'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>古老品種與火山土壤，2500年葡萄酒歷史的搖籃</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Taurasi DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>南義最頂級紅酒，Aglianico單寧之王</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#9b59b6;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #9b59b6;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級 DOCG</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(155,89,182,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #8e44ad'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#8e44ad;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#8e44ad'>Fiano di Avellino DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>濃郁白酒，火山煙燻礦物感</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(155,89,182,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #9b59b6'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#9b59b6;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#9b59b6'>Greco di Tufo DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>高酸度白酒，凝灰岩礦物感</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #e67e22;padding-bottom:8px'>✨ B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(230,126,34,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e67e22'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e67e22'>Aglianico del Taburno DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Taburno山區Aglianico</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(231,76,60,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e74c3c'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>Vesuvio DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>維蘇威火山「基督之淚」</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(46,204,113,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #2ecc71'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#2ecc71;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#2ecc71'>Campi Flegrei DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>超級火山「燃燒的田野」</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏛️ 古老葡萄酒文化的搖籃</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Campania（坎帕尼亞）位於義大利南部，<strong>Napoli（那不勒斯）</strong>是首府，擁有<strong>2500 年的葡萄酒歷史</strong>，古羅馬詩人稱讚的<strong>Falernian 葡萄酒</strong>就產自這裡。</p><p class='highlight'>🔥 Campania 以<strong>火山土壤</strong>（Vesuvius, Campi Flegrei）和<strong>古老本土品種</strong>（Aglianico, Fiano, Greco, Falanghina）聞名。</p></div><div class='campania-highlights'><div class='highlight-card'><div class='highlight-icon'>🍇</div><h4>古老品種</h4><p>Aglianico、Fiano、Greco 可追溯至古希臘時期</p></div><div class='highlight-card'><div class='highlight-icon'>🌋</div><h4>火山土壤</h4><p>Vesuvius、Campi Flegrei 賦予獨特礦物感</p></div><div class='highlight-card'><div class='highlight-icon'>🏆</div><h4>4 DOCG</h4><p>Taurasi, Fiano di Avellino, Greco di Tufo, Aglianico del Taburno</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Aglianico - 南義之王</h2><div class='aglianico-section'><div class='aglianico-intro'><h3>👑「南義的 Nebbiolo」</h3><p>Aglianico 被稱為<strong>「南義的 Nebbiolo」</strong>或<strong>「南義的 Barolo」</strong>，是義大利<strong>最高貴的紅葡萄品種之一</strong>，陳年潛力驚人（20-30 年）。</p><div class='name-origin'><p><strong>名稱來源：</strong>Aglianico 來自「Hellenico」（希臘的），證明品種源自<strong>古希臘</strong>（公元前 8 世紀）。</p></div></div><div class='aglianico-character'><h4>🍇 品種特性</h4><div class='char-grid'><div class='char-item'><strong>成熟期：</strong>極晚熟（10 月底-11 月初）</div><div class='char-item'><strong>顏色：</strong>深紫黑色，花青素極高</div><div class='char-item'><strong>單寧：</strong>極高、堅實、需長時間陳年軟化</div><div class='char-item'><strong>酸度：</strong>高，保證陳年潛力</div><div class='char-item'><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、李子、皮革、煙草、巧克力、香料</div><div class='char-item'><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14.5%</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 Taurasi DOCG - Aglianico 的巔峰</h2><div class='taurasi-section'><div class='taurasi-intro'><h3>👑 南義最頂級的紅酒</h3><p>Taurasi DOCG（1993 年升級）位於 Avellino 省內陸丘陵，被認為是<strong>南義最偉大的紅酒</strong>，與 Barolo、Brunello 齊名。</p></div><div class='taurasi-details'><div class='detail-section'><h4>📋 規定</h4><ul><li><strong>品種：</strong>Aglianico（85%+），可混 Piedirosso、Sangiovese、Barbera</li><li><strong>陳年：</strong>3 年（含 1 年橡木桶）</li><li><strong>Riserva：</strong>4 年（含 18 個月橡木桶）</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12.5%+</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 風格</h4><p><strong>年輕時（1-5 年）：</strong>單寧堅硬、酸度尖銳、深紫黑色</p><p><strong>成熟期（6-15 年）：</strong>單寧軟化、複雜度增加、石榴紅色</p><p><strong>陳年後（15-30 年）：</strong>優雅、細膩、皮革、煙草、焦油、玫瑰乾花</p></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🌟 代表酒莊</h4><ul><li><strong>Mastroberardino</strong>（Taurasi 先驅，1928 年創立）</li><li><strong>Feudi di San Gregorio</strong>（現代風格）</li><li><strong>Quintodecimo</strong>（自然派）</li><li><strong>Antonio Caggiano</strong>（傳統風格）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⚪ Campania 的白葡萄三劍客</h2><div class='white-grapes-section'><div class='white-grape-card fiano'><h3>1️⃣ Fiano di Avellino DOCG</h3><p class='grape-badge'>義大利最優質白酒之一</p><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>名稱來源：</strong>Fiano 來自拉丁文「Apianus」（蜜蜂的），因蜜蜂喜歡這種葡萄的甜味</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>濃郁、酒體飽滿、複雜、陳年潛力佳（5-10 年）</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、杏桃、榛果、蜂蜜、礦物、煙燻</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>火山土壤賦予獨特煙燻礦物感</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>龍蝦、烤魚、白松露料理、陳年起司</p></div></div><div class='white-grape-card greco'><h3>2️⃣ Greco di Tufo DOCG</h3><p class='grape-badge'>高酸度、礦物感強</p><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>Tufo：</strong>凝灰岩（火山岩），賦予強烈礦物感</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、高酸度、礦物感、陳年潛力佳</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、白桃、杏仁、礦物、火藥味</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>酸度比 Fiano 更高、更清爽、更有結構</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>生蠔、海鮮、壽司、山羊起司</p></div></div><div class='white-grape-card falanghina'><h3>3️⃣ Falanghina</h3><p class='grape-badge'>日常易飲型</p><div class='grape-info'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Campi Flegrei DOC（Napoli 附近）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>芳香、果香豐富、易飲、年輕時飲用</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白花、青蘋果、檸檬、杏仁、海鹽</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>比 Fiano 和 Greco 更輕盈、更親民</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>Mozzarella、Pizza、炸海鮮</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌋 火山葡萄酒產區</h2><div class='volcanic-regions'><div class='volcanic-card vesuvius'><h3>🌋 Vesuvio DOC</h3><div class='region-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Vesuvius 火山斜坡（Napoli 東南）</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>歐洲唯一仍活躍的火山葡萄園</p><p><strong>白酒品種：</strong>Coda di Volpe（狐狸尾巴）、Falanghina、Greco</p><p><strong>紅酒品種：</strong>Piedirosso（紅腳）、Aglianico</p><p><strong>酒款：</strong>Lacryma Christi del Vesuvio（基督之淚）- 著名的火山酒</p><p><strong>風味特點：</strong>強烈火山礦物感、煙燻、鹹感</p></div></div><div class='volcanic-card campi'><h3>🌊 Campi Flegrei DOC</h3><div class='region-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Napoli 西郊，Pozzuoli 附近</p><p><strong>Campi Flegrei：</strong>「燃燒的田野」（超級火山）</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong>Falanghina（白）、Piedirosso（紅）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>海洋 + 火山雙重影響</p><p><strong>風味特點：</strong>海鹽、礦物、火山灰、碘感</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 其他重要 Campania 葡萄酒</h2><div class='other-wines'><div class='wine-card'><h3>Aglianico del Taburno DOCG</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Taburno 山（Benevento 省）</p><p><strong>升級：</strong>2011 年 DOCG（Taurasi 的「小弟」）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>比 Taurasi 更果香、更易飲、價格更親民</p><p><strong>適飲期：</strong>3-10 年（vs Taurasi 10-30 年）</p></div></div><div class='wine-card'><h3>Lacryma Christi del Vesuvio DOC</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>名稱：</strong>「基督之淚」- 傳說耶穌為 Napoli 的罪惡流淚，淚水落地生出葡萄藤</p><p><strong>類型：</strong>紅酒、白酒、粉紅酒</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>火山礦物感強烈</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>傳說比酒本身更有名</p></div></div><div class='wine-card'><h3>Piedirosso（紅腳品種）</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>名稱來源：</strong>成熟時葡萄梗轉紅（像紅腳）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>中等酒體、果香豐富、單寧柔順</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、紫羅蘭、香料</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Campania 的日常紅酒</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍕 Napoli 美食與葡萄酒配餐</h2><div class='neapolitan-cuisine'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🍕 Pizza 的故鄉</h3><p>Napoli 是<strong>Pizza 的發源地</strong>，Campania 料理以<strong>番茄、Mozzarella 起司、海鮮、橄欖油</strong>為核心。</p></div><div class='food-pairing'><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🍕 Pizza Margherita</h4><p><strong>材料：</strong>番茄、Mozzarella di Bufala、羅勒</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Falanghina（清爽切割起司油脂）</li><li>Lacryma Christi Bianco（火山鹹感呼應）</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🧀 Mozzarella di Bufala Campana DOP</h4><p><strong>產地：</strong>Caserta、Salerno 平原</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Fiano di Avellino（濃郁呼應起司奶香）</li><li>Greco di Tufo（酸度切割油脂）</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🍝 Spaghetti alle Vongole</h4><p><strong>材料：</strong>蛤蜊、大蒜、辣椒、白酒、橄欖油</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Greco di Tufo（高酸度 + 礦物感）</li><li>Campi Flegrei Falanghina（海洋鹹感）</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🥩 烤紅肉、野味</h4><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Taurasi Riserva（單寧高、陳年潛力佳）</li><li>Aglianico del Taburno（果香豐富）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Campania 擁有 2500 年葡萄酒歷史，古羅馬時期就有 Falernian 名酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Aglianico 被稱為「南義的 Nebbiolo」，陳年潛力 20-30 年</div><div class='point'>✓ Taurasi DOCG 是南義最頂級紅酒，需陳年 3-4 年才能釋出</div><div class='point'>✓ Fiano、Greco、Falanghina 是 Campania 的白葡萄三劍客</div><div class='point'>✓ 火山土壤（Vesuvius, Campi Flegrei）賦予葡萄酒獨特礦物感</div><div class='point'>✓ Lacryma Christi del Vesuvio 是歐洲唯一仍活躍的火山葡萄園產區</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #2980b9;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.campania-highlights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.highlight-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#2980b9);padding:30px 25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.highlight-icon{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:12px}.highlight-card h4{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.2rem}.highlight-card p{margin:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1