iring-item ul{margin:5px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.pairing-item strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d6eaf8,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #2980b9;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>","quiz":[{"question":"Aglianico 為什麼被稱為「南義的 Nebbiolo」？","options":["產量相同","高單寧、高酸度、陳年潛力驚人","顏色相同","價格相同"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Aglianico 與 Nebbiolo 類似，擁有極高單寧、高酸度和驚人的陳年潛力（20-30 年），是南義最高貴的紅葡萄品種。"},{"question":"Campania 的白葡萄三劍客是？","options":["Chardonnay, Sauvignon Blanc, Pinot Grigio","Fiano, Greco, Falanghina","Trebbiano, Verdicchio, Malvasia","Garganega, Cortese, Timorasso"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Fiano di Avellino、Greco di Tufo、Falanghina 是 Campania 的代表性白葡萄品種，都是古老的本土品種。"},{"question":"Vesuvio DOC 的特點是？","options":["沒有火山","歐洲唯一仍活躍的火山葡萄園","海拔最低的產區","只產紅酒"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Vesuvio（維蘇威火山）是歐洲唯一仍活躍的火山，葡萄園位於火山斜坡，賦予葡萄酒獨特火山礦物感。"},{"question":"Taurasi DOCG 的最低陳年要求是？","options":["1 年","2 年","3 年","5 年"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Taurasi DOCG 需陳年至少 3 年（含 1 年橡木桶），Riserva 需 4 年（含 18 個月橡木桶）。"}]}
